abstract: >-
  Spontaneity filter, full utterance-level manifest, experimental sets and
  human annotation results for a study of register-controlled evaluation of
  speech recognition on spontaneous Kazakh-Russian conversational speech.
  Code under MIT, data under CC BY 4.0; see LICENSE and LICENSE-DATA. No
  audio and no transcript text of the underlying KSC2 corpus is redistributed.
